  <p>The Alliance (Fort Division) is the largest hero team in the Fort. As a division of the national Alliance,
  they fall under the direction of <a href="/parahumans/bopa">BOPA</a>.</p>

  <h2>Members</h2>
  <h3>Flawless</h3>
  <p>Flawless is the leader of the Alliance (Fort Division). His body is made entirely of a type of sky-blue crystal
  of a type previously unknown to science. This makes Flawless impervious to explosive force, gunshots, and other
  physical attacks. Flawless wears a striking black bodysuit.</p>
  <p>Flawless also has enhanced strength, able to shatter concrete and lift cars.</p>
  <h3>Habi</h3>
  <p>Habi is a tinker, specialising in fabrics. Her costume is mostly bright yellow, with iridescent red and blue trim.
  She has said the design is modelled after a sunbird. It is packed with various powerful fabric technology,
  such as gecko-grip fingertips, kinetic impact points, and static electricity blasts.</p>
  <h3>Waterhazard</h3>
  <p>Waterhazard can spit high pressure steams of water from her mouth. She wears a bodysuit with dark red armour panelling.</p>
  <h3>Warmup</h3>
  <p>Powers include super strength and super speed, triggered by charging up kinetic energy. She wears
  a practical suit themed after gymwear.</p>
  <h3>Crucible</h3>
  <p>Crucible was a trade between the Philippines Alliance and the United States' Protectorate. He is able to
  create a spherical forcefield around himself or others. He wears a green and orange suit, and a mask with goggles.</p>
</ParahumanWikiLayout>